## 3  Kubernetes — Create a ReplicaSet with 3 Replicas

---
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: ReplicaSet
metadata:
  name: pathnex-replicaset
spec: 
  replica: 3
  selector:
    matchLables:
      app: pathnex-app
    template:
      metadate:
        app: pathnex-app
      spec: 
        containers:
          - name: app
            image: nginx
            ports: 
              - constainerPort: 80
---
